## Output Keys

| Field | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| foundedYear | int | Year the company was founded in |
| id | string | The id of the company in Tracxn DB |
| name | string | The name of the company |
| domain | string | The domain of the company |
| location | object | Location details of the company |
| tracxnUrl | string | This is the URL of the company in Tracxn |
| businessModelList | List | List of all feeds and business models of the company. For most use cases, we recommend using sectorList key over businessModelList. |
| practiceAreaList | List | A list of the practice areas the company is tagged under. |
| description.long | string | A long description of the company |
| description.short | string | A short description of the company in 15-20 words |
| contactNumberList | List | Gives a list of contact numbers of the company |
| emailList | List | Gives a list of emails of the company |
| employeeInfo | object | Gives details about the employees of the company |
| companyRatings | object | Details about the various ratings of a company |
| stage | string | Gives details about the stage of the company |
| acquirerInfo | object | Gives details about the companies which have acquired the company in consideration |
| ipoInfo | object | Gives IPO details of a public company |
| deadpoolInfo | object | Gives details about the deadpooling of the company |
| fundingInfo | object | Gives details about the funding raised by the company |
| acquisitionList | object | List of companies acquired by the company in consideration |
